---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Container from '../components/primitives/Container.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/primitives/SectionHeading.astro';
import Prose from '../components/primitives/Prose.astro';
import AssociationLogos from '../components/blocks/AssociationLogos.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const taglineClass =
  'border-l-4 border-(--accent) pl-4 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-(--text-strong) sm:text-xl';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About Us"
  kicker="About"
  description={`Founded in Phoenix in January ${site.founded}, J & L Transportation provides intermodal drayage and dedicated truckload transportation throughout Arizona and the western United States, with service into Mexico.`}
  lead="The reasons you'll choose us for your carrier needs."
>
  <Container width="prose" class="py-section">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-16">
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <SectionHeading as="h2" kicker="History" title="Our History">
          <p>Nearly Four Decades of Experience, Integrity, and Dependable Transportation</p>
        </SectionHeading>
        <Prose size="lg">
          <p>
            Founded in January {site.founded}, J&amp;L Transportation began with a vision to provide
            dependable, efficient, and customer-focused transportation services. Established in
            Phoenix, Arizona, the company built its foundation on hard work, industry expertise, and
            a commitment to delivering exceptional service.
          </p>
          <p>
            Co-founder Michael H. Jimenez brought extensive hands-on experience to the business,
            having worked in the trucking industry since 1972 as a driver, mechanic, and business
            owner. His understanding of transportation operations, combined with a commitment to
            honest business practices, helped establish J&amp;L as a respected name in the industry.
          </p>
          <p>
            Over the decades, J&amp;L Transportation has grown into an established provider of
            intermodal transportation, drayage, and dedicated trucking services. Through responsible
            growth, experienced leadership, and long-standing customer relationships, the company has
            expanded its reach throughout Arizona and the western United States, with service
            capabilities extending into Mexico.
          </p>
          <p>
            Throughout its history, J&amp;L has remained committed to the principles that shaped its
            beginnings: safety, integrity, reliability, and exceptional customer service. These values
            continue to guide daily operations, from maintaining equipment and supporting drivers to
            ensuring that customers receive the dependable transportation solutions their businesses
            require.
          </p>
          <p>
            As J&amp;L Transportation approaches its 40th anniversary, the company remains proud of
            its history and focused on its future. While the transportation industry continues to
            evolve, J&amp;L&rsquo;s commitment to its customers, employees, and the communities it
            serves remains unchanged.
          </p>
        </Prose>
        <p class={taglineClass}>
          Built on Experience. Driven by Integrity. Trusted Since {site.founded}.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <SectionHeading as="h2" kicker="Operations" title="Current Operations">
          <p>Reliable Transportation. Experienced Professionals. Dependable Service.</p>
        </SectionHeading>
        <Prose size="lg">
          <p>
            Today, J&amp;L Transportation continues to serve as a trusted transportation and logistics
            provider, delivering dependable freight solutions throughout Arizona and the western United
            States. With nearly four decades of industry experience, we combine operational
            expertise, a company-owned fleet, and dedicated personnel to meet the evolving needs of
            our customers.
          </p>
          <p>
            J&amp;L specializes in intermodal drayage and dedicated truckload transportation,
            providing reliable freight movement tailored to customer needs. Our transportation
            operations are scheduled to accommodate the individual needs of our customers, providing
            flexibility and dependable service beyond standard business hours. Our administrative and
            customer service offices are open Monday through Friday, from 6:00 AM to 5:00 PM.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our drayage operations serve Arizona, northern Nevada, and Sonora, Mexico, connecting
            customers to critical rail and freight transportation networks. Our dedicated truckload
            services extend throughout Arizona, California, Nevada, New Mexico, and Texas, offering
            flexible regional and interstate transportation solutions.
          </p>
          <p>
            At the center of our operations is a commitment to safety, reliability, and
            accountability. Our company-owned fleet is supported by experienced drivers, dispatch
            personnel, and an in-house maintenance team. This hands-on approach allows us to maintain
            operational oversight, prioritize equipment reliability, and deliver consistent service.
          </p>
          <p>
            We understand that successful transportation requires more than moving freight. It
            requires dependable communication, attention to detail, and a commitment to meeting
            customer expectations.
          </p>
          <p>
            As the transportation industry evolves, J&amp;L remains focused on maintaining high
            operational standards, strengthening customer relationships, and delivering the
            dependable service that has defined our company since {site.founded}.
          </p>
        </Prose>
        <p class={taglineClass}>
          Built on Experience. Driven by Reliability. Trusted Since {site.founded}.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <SectionHeading as="h2" kicker="Mission" title="Our Mission Statement" />
        <div
          class="rounded-(--radius-card) border-l-4 border-(--accent) bg-(--surface-sunken) p-6 sm:p-8"
        >
          <Prose size="lg">
            <p>
              At J&amp;L Transportation, our mission is to provide safe, reliable, and efficient
              transportation solutions through experienced professionals, dependable equipment, and
              an unwavering commitment to customer service. We strive to build lasting relationships
              through integrity, accountability, and consistent performance while maintaining the
              values that have defined our company since {site.founded}.
            </p>
          </Prose>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </Container>

  <div class="border-t border-(--border-subtle)">
    <AssociationLogos />
  </div>
</PageLayout>
